{"sourceUrl":"https://ceo.nankai.edu.cn/info/1099/4637.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:04.358531+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ceo.nankai.edu.cn/info/1099/4637.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>一、</span><span><span>我院</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生</span><span>（</span><span>含直博生</span><span>）</span><span>的外语水平要求为：</span></p>\n<p><span>外语语种为英语。英语成绩须符合以下任一项：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）通过全国大学英语六级考试（六级成绩425分及以上）或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（四级成绩550分及以上）；  </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）TOEFL成绩90分（120分制）及以上或4.5分（6分制）及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）IELTS（A类/学术类）成绩6分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）GRE成绩在310以上，GMAT成绩在640以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5）英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、我院</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年所有招生专业的可接收推免生</span><span>（</span><span>含直博生</span><span>）</span><span><span>本科专业范围要求为：</span><span>07理学、08工学。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"d030c40371fbfc3b971c3157e8030ca8ef875cdadfaac10472c71ed8005015c7","textLength":271,"sourceSha256":"0eed619d39efd1b760aef6122a98b6a540d9b29c4461a3263793590dfea74df7","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-439e3fc11f9d048e8d28","title":"2026年南开大学电子信息与光学工程学院2027年接收推免生（含直博生）外语水平及本科专业范围要求","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:04.358531+00:00"}
